## Project-specific settings

# REPOS is present but content-ignored: its README is tracked and everything else inside stays local.
REPOS/*
!REPOS/README.md

# Personal drop zone -- never tracked
TEMP/

# Build output
/brains.exe
/brains


## General settings

# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
!coverage.go
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Secrets / local config
.env
